#: dtime.cpp:71
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here you can change the system date's day of the month, month and year."
msgstr "Livir tu kari roja rêkkewta (date) sîtemê biguhere."

#: dtime.cpp:124
msgid ""
"Here you can change the system time. Click into the hours, minutes or "
"seconds field to change the relevant value, either using the up and down "
"buttons to the right or by entering a new value."
msgstr ""
"Livir tu kari demjimêra sîstemê biguhere. Bitikîne ser xana demjimêran, "
"hurdemanyan çirkan jibo ku tu nirxên wane biguherîne, herweha tu kari "
"nirxan bi dûgma jêr û jor biguherîne yanjî nirxên nuh binivîsîne."

#: dtime.cpp:223
msgid "Can not set date."
msgstr "Rêkkewt (date) nayête sazkirin."

#: dtime.cpp:252 main.cpp:89
msgid ""
"<h1>Date & Time</h1> This control module can be used to set the system date "
"and time. As these settings do not only affect you as a user, but rather the "
"whole system, you can only change these settings when you start the Control "
"Center as root. If you don't have the root password, but feel the system "
"time should be corrected, please contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Rêkewt (date) û Dem</h1> Ev kontrolmodul bikarbîne jibo guhrîna "
"rêkkewt û dema systemê. Jiber ku ev danan ji sîstema te re ye û ne "
"bitenê ji te re ye, tu kari vêna tenê biguhere heger tu wek root (kok) "
"sentera kontrolê bajo. Heger tu nihênî (password)ê nasnake, û di ramana "
"te de Dem û Rêkkewta systemê şaşe fermo ji birêvebirê systemê (root) "
"re bêje hew ew bitenê kari vî tiştî bike."

#: tzone.cpp:62
msgid "Current time zone: "
msgstr "Zone ya Demî ya aktuel: "

#: tzone.cpp:69
